    <RestrictedAreaNavigational gml:id="f14">
      <s100:featureObjectIdentifier>
        <s100:agency>CN</s100:agency>
        <s100:featureIdentificationNumber>1992</s100:featureIdentificationNumber>
        <s100:featureIdentificationSubdivision>1</s100:featureIdentificationSubdivision>
      </s100:featureObjectIdentifier>
      <fixedDateRange>
        <dateEnd>
          <s100:date>2031-09-14</s100:date>
        </dateEnd>
        <dateStart>
          <s100:date>2026-09-15</s100:date>
        </dateStart>
      </fixedDateRange>
      <featureName>
        <language>eng</language>
        <name>Pinglu Canal</name>
      </featureName>
      <featureName>
        <displayName>true</displayName>
        <language>zho</language>
        <name>平陆运河</name>
      </featureName>
      <sourceIndication>
        <categoryOfAuthority code="15">maritime</categoryOfAuthority>
        <countryName>China</countryName>
        <reportedDate>
          <s100:date>2026-08-25</s100:date>
        </reportedDate>
        <source>Announcement No.17第17号公告</source>
        <sourceType code="1">law or regulation</sourceType>
        <featureName>
          <language>eng</language>
          <name>CHINA MSA</name>
        </featureName>
        <featureName>
          <language>zho</language>
          <name>中华人民共和国海事局</name>
        </featureName>
      </sourceIndication>
      <textContent>
        <categoryOfText code="1">abstract or summary</categoryOfText>
        <information>
          <headline>Article 6</headline>
          <language>eng</language>
          <text>Keep an effective listening watch on VHF Channel 16.</text>
        </information>
        <information>
          <headline>第六条</headline>
          <language>zho</language>
          <text>保持 VHF16 频道有效值守。</text>
        </information>
        <information>
          <headline>Article 7</headline>
          <language>eng</language>
          <text>Before entering the Pinglu Canal, entering or leaving anchorages, berthing or unberthing, and arriving at the Qinjiang Bridge of G75 Lan‑Hai Expressway Qinjiang River Bridge, vessels shall report on VHF Channel 13 as required by the maritime administrative agency.</text>
        </information>
        <information>
          <headline>第七条</headline>
          <language>zho</language>
          <text>船舶在进入平陆运河前和进出锚地、靠离码头、抵达G75兰海高速钦江大桥前，应当按照海事管理机构要求通过VHF13频道进行报告。</text>
        </information>
        <information>
          <headline>Article 12</headline>
          <language>eng</language>
          <text>Bounded by the fairway centerline, the water area on the right side when facing downstream of the canal shall be the downbound traffic lane, and the water area on the left side shall be the upbound traffic lane. &#13;
Vessels shall navigate on the starboard side of their respective traffic lanes and pass each other port to port.</text>
        </information>
        <information>
          <headline>第十二条</headline>
          <language>zho</language>
          <text>以航道中心线为界，面向运河下游方向右侧水域为下行通航分道，左侧水域为上行通航分道。&#13;
船舶应当按照通航分道各自靠右航行，互以左舷会船。</text>
        </information>
        <information>
          <headline>Article 17</headline>
          <language>eng</language>
          <text>When a vessel passes through a navigable bridge opening, in principle, a clearance height of more than 2 meters shall be reserved.</text>
        </information>
        <information>
          <headline>第十七条</headline>
          <language>zho</language>
          <text>船舶通过桥梁通航桥孔时，原则上应当保留2米以上的富裕净空高度。</text>
        </information>
        <information>
          <headline>Article 20</headline>
          <language>eng</language>
          <text>No more than two vessels shall enter or leave the same anchorage, berth, mooring or safety operation area at the same time; a vessel crossing a traffic lane to exit shall wait and give way to vessels exiting in the direction of the traffic flow.</text>
        </information>
        <information>
          <headline>第二十条</headline>
          <language>zho</language>
          <text>两艘以上船舶不得同时进出同一锚地、码头、泊位、安全作业区；横越通航分道驶出的船舶应当等让顺船舶流向驶出的船舶。</text>
        </information>
        <information>
          <headline>Article 26</headline>
          <language>eng</language>
          <text>Vessels entering or leaving the Pinglu Canal shall proactively give way to vessels navigating along the Yujiang River in the direction of the fairway, and shall not cross, turn around, drift, or anchor in the Pingtang Estuary waters.&#13;
Vessels departing from the Pinglu Canal and entering the Yujiang River shall turn to starboard to enter the downbound traffic lane of the Yujiang River.&#13;
 Vessels intending to proceed upbound shall first proceed downbound past the Pingtang Estuary waters, then choose an opportunity to turn around and proceed upbound along the upbound traffic lane of the Yujiang River.&#13;
&#13;
Vessels entering the Pinglu Canal from the Yujiang River: downbound vessels shall turn directly to starboard into the Pinglu Canal;&#13;
 upbound vessels shall proceed past the Pingtang Estuary waters, then choose an opportunity to turn around, and turn to starboard into the Pinglu C&#13;
anal via the downbound traffic lane of the Yujiang River.</text>
        </information>
        <information>
          <headline>第二十六条</headline>
          <language>zho</language>
          <text>船舶进出平陆运河时，应当主动避让郁江顺航道航行的船舶，且不得在平塘江口水域横越、掉头、淌航、锚泊。&#13;
从平陆运河驶入郁江的船舶，应当右转驶入郁江下行航路，需上行的船舶应当下行驶过平塘江口水域后择机掉头，沿郁江上行航路上行。&#13;
从郁江驶入平陆运河的船舶，下行船舶直接右转驶入平陆运河，上行船舶应当驶过平塘江口水域后择机掉头，沿郁江下行航路右转驶入。</text>
        </information>
      </textContent>
      <restriction code="unknown" xsi:nil="true"/>
