        <information>
          <headline>Article 15</headline>
          <language>eng</language>
          <text>The safe distance from the preceding vessel shall not be less than twice the length of the own vessel (not applicable to the waters of navigation structures).</text>
        </information>
        <information>
          <headline>第十五条</headline>
          <language>zho</language>
          <text>与前船安全距离不得少于2倍本船船长（不适用于通航建筑物水域）。</text>
        </information>
        <information>
          <headline>Article 19</headline>
