    <RestrictedAreaNavigational gml:id="f33">
      <s100:featureObjectIdentifier>
        <s100:agency>CN</s100:agency>
        <s100:featureIdentificationNumber>2011</s100:featureIdentificationNumber>
        <s100:featureIdentificationSubdivision>1</s100:featureIdentificationSubdivision>
      </s100:featureObjectIdentifier>
      <fixedDateRange>
        <dateEnd>
          <s100:date>2031-09-14</s100:date>
        </dateEnd>
        <dateStart>
          <s100:date>2026-09-15</s100:date>
        </dateStart>
      </fixedDateRange>
      <featureName>
        <language>eng</language>
        <name>Pinglu Canal Fairway</name>
      </featureName>
      <featureName>
        <displayName>true</displayName>
        <language>zho</language>
        <name>平陆运河航道</name>
      </featureName>
      <sourceIndication>
        <categoryOfAuthority code="15">maritime</categoryOfAuthority>
        <countryName>China</countryName>
        <reportedDate>
          <s100:date>2026-08-25</s100:date>
        </reportedDate>
        <source>Announcement No.17第17号公告</source>
        <sourceType code="1">law or regulation</sourceType>
        <featureName>
          <language>eng</language>
          <name>CHINA MSA</name>
        </featureName>
        <featureName>
          <language>zho</language>
          <name>中华人民共和国海事局</name>
        </featureName>
      </sourceIndication>
      <textContent>
        <categoryOfText code="1">abstract or summary</categoryOfText>
        <information>
          <headline>Article 9</headline>
          <language>eng</language>
          <text>The following acts endangering navigation safety are prohibited within the fairway:&#13;
(1) Sailing abreast;&#13;
(2) Berthing alongside bank slopes;&#13;
(3) Overtaking a vessel which is in the course of overtaking another vessel;&#13;
(4) Overtaking or drifting in special waters such as curved fairway sections and navigational structures;&#13;
&#13;
&#13;
(6) Navigation, berthing and operation of rafts, motorboats and auxiliary craft.</text>
        </information>
        <information>
          <headline>第九条</headline>
          <language>zho</language>
          <text>在航道内，禁止下列影响通航安全的行为：&#13;
（一） 并列行驶；&#13;
（二） 抵坡停泊；&#13;
（三） 追越正在追越的船舶；&#13;
（四） 在弯曲航段、通航建筑物等特殊水域追越或者淌航；&#13;
（六） 排筏、摩托艇、附属艇等航行、停泊和作业。</text>
        </information>
      </textContent>
